---
description: Check proposed uses against garden rules and access paths without inventing agronomic facts.
args: { garden: GardenDossier; conditions: PlotConditionMap[] }
returns: string[]
---
Identify the current rules and every shared access route from supplied evidence. Flag an alternative that blocks a required route, exceeds a known resource limit, or depends on an unassessed condition. Refer consequential interventions to the named local expert role; do not prescribe unsupported treatment.
